  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41105001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "3——2——1——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "点火！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "报告，水火箭已顺利完成一级加速。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "ok的说……接，接下来就是关键的二级加速！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "嘭——咻——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "大危机的说，二级加速瓶子开始漏水……哇呼！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "41105008",
              "text": "在我们头上完美地形成了水花呢。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "41105008",
              "text": "啊，衣服湿了。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "41105007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "第5次「水火箭自动花园洒水功能」的发射试验也完全变成water了的说……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不过比上次的实验进步了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "积极来考虑的话是这样的呢……上次差点砸到粮丸的饭碗，真是十分sorry的说……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不过我因此知道粮丸原来对接水火箭也有一番心得呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼……和斯特列尔卡、威尔卡一样呢，很厉害的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哈哈，那我们继续下一次发射实验吧，感觉就快要成功了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "要是以后让水火箭给花园浇水的话，大家就能轻松很多了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "有道理的说，为了大家，现在可不是气馁的时候！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41105016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "下次一定会是big big success的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
